# Copy to .env.boox and fill in the upload URL and existing device base directory.
# Create matching subfolders (lectures, exercises, matlab-review) on the device.
# Paths below BOOX_PDF_DIR are preserved beneath BOOX_REMOTE_DIR.
# Literal values only; quote spaces. Exported environment overrides this file.
BOOX_UPLOAD_URL=""
BOOX_REMOTE_DIR=""
BOOX_PDF_DIR="output"
BOOX_CONNECT_TIMEOUT="1"
BOOX_UPLOAD_TIMEOUT="15"
# Optional: state path (relative to repository or absolute); default is Git-local.
# BOOX_STATE_FILE=""
# Set BOOX_ENV_FILE in the environment to use another configuration file.
